// Detects authentication to a LiteLLM proxy using the known default master key (sk-1234), consistent with
// exploitation of instances left with the default credential (present in ~9.6% of scanned internet-facing
// deployments per Wiz research). Narrowed to actual credential usage (Bearer sk-1234) rather than any bare
// reference to the string or generic unauthenticated requests, which produced excessive noise.
ContainerLogV2
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where PodName has "litellm" or ContainerName has "litellm"
| where LogMessage has "Bearer sk-1234"
| project TimeGenerated, PodName, ContainerName, LogMessage
| sort by TimeGenerated desc